Joseph Cox reports: A high profile hacking group claims it has breached multiple FBI-related services and stolen data “on all FBI employees and applicants.” A representative of the group, called ShinyHunters, told 404 Media the data includes FBI agents’ names, home addresses, phone number, and information on their spouse. The data breach could be massively...
<p><a href="https://databreaches.net/2026/09/22/shinyhunters-escalates-dispute-with-fbi-claims-to-have-seized-job-applicants-site-and-acquired-data/">Source</a></p>

